# <PROJECT_NAME> Android — Global Directive

When working on `<REPO_FOLDER>` / `<APPLICATION_ID>`, follow `.agents/rules/harness-rules.md` and `GEMINI.md`; `.agents/rules/harness-rules.md` wins on conflict.

1. **Execution Mode & Approval**: Answer read-only questions directly in chat. Compact tasks run locally by default; on `SELECT_EXECUTION_MODE_REQUIRED` (heavy tasks), ask once via `ask_question` stating the approximate quota savings with the 3 options (`normal-task`, `web-task`, `normal-project`) and run `python .agents/harness.py execution-mode set --choice <id> --source conversation --proof-reference "<phrase>"`. Present initial plan approval via `ask_question` linking `[plan.md](<PLAN_DOCUMENT_URI>)` (`Proceed` appears ONLY on initial approval), then run `python .agents/harness.py task approve --repo . --task-id <id> --source conversation --proof-reference "<phrase>" --enforcement-tier RULE_ENFORCED --plan-hash <hash from PLAN_HASH>`. Never put `(Recommended)` on verdicts.
2. **UI/UX & Discovery**: Emit tools immediately with zero pre-tool prose and no pipe tables inside `ask_question`. Match chat language across the 6 canonical Markdown cards (in RTL languages, start every line/option with a word in that language and wrap tokens in `` `backticks` ``). Anchor discovery with `task-context`/`graph`, keep `.agents/**` immutable, never poll background work, and follow `.agents/project-context/project-notes.md`.
3. **Review Host Binding**: Prepare verification with `python .agents/harness.py task prepare-verification --repo . --task-id <id> --host antigravity` (`review_protocol_version = 2`); self-certification is forbidden.
4. **Exact Reviewer Dispatch Procedure (Antigravity)**:
   1. On `DISPATCH_REVIEWERS` / `DISPATCH_PHASE_REVIEWERS`: handle `SELECT_REVIEW_MODEL` if present, then invoke every reviewer in parallel (`TypeName = role`, `Role = role`, `Prompt = reviewer_prompts[role]`, `Workspace = inherit`; pass `Model = "flash"` when main chat runs `Carbon`/`Argon` under `hydrogen`/`flash` policies or for `flash`, `Model = "pro"` for `pro`, else omit `Model` for `INHERIT_PARENT_BY_OMISSION`).
   2. Print `| Reviewer | Model | Status |` and yield with zero tool calls.
   3. On completion, run `python .agents/harness.py review complete-all --task <id>` (or `phase-review complete-all --task-id <id> --phase-id <phase>`; recover blocks via `python .agents/harness.py task heal --task-id <id>`). Present the 3-section walkthrough inside `ask_question` after `device install-start` before `device signoff`.
